<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Solar for business means replacing generator hours with panels, an inverter and a battery sized to what your premises actually runs. It covers shops, offices, schools, clinics, churches, filling stations and small factories in Lagos, Abuja, Port Harcourt, Ibadan, Benin City and Enugu. This site installs nothing itself; it puts you in touch with independent installers who quote the job.</p><p>The process is the same at any size: a load audit from your rating plates, a site survey for anything bigger than a small shop, then a written quote naming every model. Every price on this page is a published figure from one named source, never our quote, so get two or three comparable written quotes before you commit. Call now on +234 809 000 0000.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Handle</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What's Included in Every Visit</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Generator hours replaced</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">The aim is fewer litres of diesel or petrol bought each week, worked out from your own fuel log and the price per litre you pay.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Load audit from rating plates</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">The installer lists every AC, freezer, pumping machine and motor from its rating plate, with the hours each one runs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Daytime-load matching</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Loads that run in daylight draw on panel output directly, so the battery is sized for evenings and outages rather than the whole day.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Three-phase options</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">If your DB is fed three-phase, say so at the start so the quote covers a three-phase hybrid inverter instead of a single-phase one.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">Site survey for larger systems</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Anything above a small shop is quoted after a survey of the roof or ground, the DB, the earthing and the cable routes.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E6DFCF;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(31,34,49,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#1B1D2A;margin:0 0 8px;">A quote you can compare</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Ask for inverter, battery and panel models, counts, warranty terms and the VAT treatment written down, so two quotes can sit side by side.</p>
      </div>
</div>
